{"skill":{"slug":"content-quality-auditor","displayName":"Content Quality Auditor"},"version":{"version":"19.0.0","createdAt":1784903178043,"changelog":"Content Quality Auditor 19.0.0\n\n- Refined the reporting section: lead report now details audit status, verdict, score state, and both raw and final scores with clearer, typed formatting.\n- Reports must now explicitly print each missing applicable item as its qualified ID with the state unknown; generic \"evidence gap\" wording is no longer allowed for gaps.\n- Removed legacy support and redundant documentation files for a cleaner repository.\n- Added a distribution manifest for installation or deployment tracking.\n- Updated version and metadata to 19.0.0 to reflect major contract and reporting changes.","changelogSource":"auto","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":10998,"sha256":"f0bb33cceefce8d68ada3c87e61f827e4236470f7af8f37c4347eef8bdeb8517","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"distribution-manifest.json","size":1556,"sha256":"e23706349e2e7ca1153753703498fd30dfc24b5da80fd3f667b57037d75ef4a1","contentType":"application/json"},{"path":"references/auditor-runtime.md","size":10904,"sha256":"691f1a74013978984d53b2128d769edaf74435ef9f5df268373b553adb652835","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/item-reference.md","size":5464,"sha256":"3d99ec12c89589e3fd7ac6544f122f8fcf5328173c15c94b942ca19f9cbb8495","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/recursive-refinement.md","size":3591,"sha256":"efe7b67ca28643131cd13c271c2b2f68cbe8b366fffd544d68baca5d457fefcf","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2690,"sha256":"5fc4719879e2a02ce616d7c9cb04d5c24cff16692f726a5db3b549c8eaaee99d","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789053399904,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"c74fb4e642d94920d10035ded9a327d47c7008e31b1815dce133c4bbb6b01e56","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/c74fb4e642d94920d10035ded9a327d47c7008e31b1815dce133c4bbb6b01e56","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1784906512146},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":0,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":0,"checkedAt":1789053399904},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a content-quality auditor with disclosed, purpose-aligned page fetching, scoring, and optional user-approved audit saving.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The skill can fetch URLs and, in a full repository/plugin install, calls local scorer and validator scripts if a verified runtime exists; the standalone fallback fails closed instead of downloading mutable code or inventing scores.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The package is a standalone markdown skill with bundled references and a distribution manifest; no executable scripts are shipped in the artifact.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Instructions are scoped to one declared artifact, content profile, market, publication state, and observation date; fetched page content is explicitly treated as untrusted evidence.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Persistence is not automatic: audit artifacts may be written only with explicit user authorization, to a constrained memory/audits/content path, after validation.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is CORE-EEAT content quality and publish-readiness auditing, and the artifacts focus on collecting evidence, evaluating typed rubric items, and reporting gaps.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Before installing, be aware that this skill may fetch the page or content you ask it to audit and may use local scoring scripts in a full plugin install. Only authorize persistent audit files when you want an audit record saved.","findings":null,"agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789053399904}}}}}